      "subject": "fix(auth): retry signup credit grant on session keepalive",
      "body": "The signup grant fires on login but silently fails if z-billing is\nunreachable. Daily and monthly grants are gated on signup_grant_at,\nso affected users are permanently stuck at 0 credits.\n\nNow retries the grant on GET /api/auth/session (called on app boot\nand every 20s keepalive). Deduped with an in-memory DashSet so it\nonly hits z-billing once per user per server process. The z-billing\nendpoint is idempotent — already-granted users are a no-op.",
